# Design System

## Colors
- **Background**: `#000000` (Pure Black)
- **Primary Accent**: `#4FD6EA` (Cyan/Teal)
- **Secondary Accent**: `#222222` (Dark Gray - Cards/Inputs)
- **Text Primary**: `#FFFFFF` (White)
- **Text Secondary**: `#888888` (Gray)
- **Border/Divider**: `#333333`

## Components

### Buttons
- **PrimaryButton**: 
  - Height: 52px
  - Radius: 10px
  - Background: White (or Accent depending on context, usually White for primary actions on dark)
  - Text: Black, 16px, SemiBold

### Inputs
- **Text Input**:
  - Background: Transparent
  - Border: Bottom Border (`#333`)
  - Title/Label: Uppercase, `#888`, 12px, SemiBold
  - Text: White, 16px (Normal) / 24px (Large Headers)

### Dropdown
- **Style**: Integrated, Dark Theme
- **Behavior**: Dropdown list appears below selector.
- **Background**: `#222`
- **Border**: `#333`

## Layout Patterns
- **Screen Background**: Global `#000`
- **Padding**: Horizontal 20px
- **Alignment**: Text and Inputs Left-Aligned
- **Header**: Standard "Back" arrow, "Step X of Y", Title Left-Aligned (content)
